hdmi_out.c is a rewrite of the Module Display 13.2 driver found in M5GFX (Panel_M5HDMI.cpp), reduced to
plain ESP-IDF calls.  Protocol constants, the video timing search and the LT8618 register tables (lt8618_tables.h) come
from that file.

